hadiths[8]{hadithnumber,text}:
"334","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham tajjub karte hain us par jo mahine se pehle [roza rakh kar] aage badhta hai; beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya hai: 'Jab tum use [Ramadan ka chand] dekho to roza rakho, aur jab tum use [Shawwal ka chand] dekho to iftar karo. Phir agar tum par badal chha jae to ginti tees poori karo.'"
"335","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab tum chand dekho to roza rakho, aur jab tum use dekho to iftar karo. Phir agar tum par badal chha jae to us ka andaza karo.' Ravi kehte hain: Aur Abdullah chand se ek din pehle roza rakhte. Ibrahim se kaha gaya: Kya tum us se pehle [roza rakh kar] aage badhte ho? Unhon ne kaha: Ji."
"336","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Ramadan se pehle ek din ya do din [roza rakh kar] aage na badho, siwae us aadmi ke jo [Peer-Jumerat ya Dawud ka] roza rakhta ho, to woh use rakhe.'"
"337","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Ramadan ka zikr farmaya aur farmaya: 'Chand dekhe baghair roza na rakho, aur use dekhe baghair iftar na karo. Phir agar tum par badal chha jae to us ka andaza karo.'"
"338","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abdullah bin Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Mahina untees [din] ka [bhi] hota hai; chand dekhe baghair roza na rakho, aur use dekhe baghair iftar na karo. Phir agar tum par badal chha jae to ginti tees poori karo.'"
"339","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Mahine se ek din aur na do din [roza rakh kar] aage na badho, siwae is ke ke woh us roze se mil jae jo tum mein se koi rakhta ho. Us ke dekhne par roza rakho, aur us ke dekhne par iftar karo. Phir agar tum par badal chha jae to tees gino phir iftar karo.'"
"340","[AI-translation] Amr bin Sulaim Zuraqi ki walida (Rahimahallah) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jabke ham Mina mein the ke Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) oont par [sawar] kehte hue [aaye]: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) farmate hain: 'Beshak yeh din khane aur peene ke din hain; koi roza na rakhe.' To woh logon ke peeche gae jabke woh apne oont par un mein yeh pukarte the."
"341","[AI-translation] Abu Murrah, Amr bin Al-Aas ke aazad karda ghulam (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke woh aur Abdullah bin Umar, Amr bin Al-Aas ke paas dakhil hue, aur woh yomul Azha ke agle din ki subah thi. To Amr ne un ke paas khana rakha. To Abdullah ne un se kaha: Beshak main rozedar hun. To Amr ne kaha: 'Iftar karo; kyunke yeh din woh hain jin mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) iftar ka hukm dete aur roze se mana farmate.' Abu Murrah kehte hain: To Abdullah ne iftar kiya; unhon ne khaya aur main ne un ke sath khaya."
